Doesn't look like
we'd make it that long.

678
00:31:37.962 --> 00:31:41.799
-Do I have to pull rank here?
-Let your Ark go.

679
00:31:41.866 --> 00:31:44.903
One more solar max could
wipe out their life support.

680
00:31:44.969 --> 00:31:47.071
We don't want
anyone else sacrificed

681
00:31:47.138 --> 00:31:48.606
for your mistake in coming here.

682
00:31:48.673 --> 00:31:52.176
-Hang on just a sec.
-He's right.

683
00:31:52.243 --> 00:31:53.778
