684
00:31:53.845 --> 00:31:55.405
-It's too risky for you to stay.
-No.

685
00:31:55.446 --> 00:31:57.081
-No way.
-Ian. listen to me.

686
00:31:57.148 --> 00:31:59.651
It's OK.
We'll find a way to survive.

687
00:31:59.717 --> 00:32:01.185
