but I'm all out of ideas.

692
00:32:10.962 --> 00:32:13.231
Come on. Ian.

693
00:32:13.298 --> 00:32:14.632
Wait.

694
00:32:14.699 --> 00:32:16.534
Wait.
I have an idea.

695
00:32:16.601 --> 00:32:18.002
Did it come from your dream?

696
00:32:18.069 --> 00:32:20.638
Those things down there.
they avoid sunlight. right?

697
00:32:20.705 --> 00:32:21.806
Yeah.

698
00:32:21.873 --> 00:32:24.142
So all we have to do
is create more sunlight.

699
00:32:24.208 --> 00:32:25.576
