700
00:32:25.643 --> 00:32:30.248
This Ark is equipped
with solar sails. isn't it?

701
00:32:30.315 --> 00:32:32.750
Yes. and they're
highly reflective.

702
00:32:32.817 --> 00:32:33.618
Reflective.

703
00:32:33.685 --> 00:32:35.853
Ian. you're a genius!

704
00:32:35.920 --> 00:32:38.256
Come on.

705
00:32:38.323 --> 00:32:41.059
Captain Garnet. we might
be able to use the solar sails

706
00:32:41.125 --> 00:32:44.295
to reflect sunlight to the
surface. make a path for you.

707
00:32:44.362 --> 00:32:47.065
Alicia. you little beauty.

708
00:32:47.131 --> 00:32:49.267
Do it.

709
00:32:49.334 --> 00:32:50.814
