711
00:32:56.374 --> 00:32:58.443
Grab a helmet.

712
00:33:22.133 --> 00:33:23.835
OK. Go.

713
00:33:51.996 --> 00:33:53.731
Run!

714
00:33:53.798 --> 00:33:56.367
Doc!

715
00:34:04.008 --> 00:34:05.410
Shit!

716
00:34:05.476 --> 00:34:06.954
Sails are starting to burn up.

717
00:34:06.978 --> 00:34:09.914
-Hurry.
-Kimi. keep going!

718
00:34:09.981 --> 00:34:11.149
-OK.
-Let's go.

719
00:34:14.085 --> 00:34:15.319
Any ideas?

720
00:34:15.386 --> 00:34:17.264
We're going to have
to go through the darkness.

721
00:34:17.288 --> 00:34:18.856
Shoot our way out?

722
00:34:18.923 --> 00:34:20.391
He said bullets don't stop them.

723
00:34:20.458 --> 00:34:23.428
Yeah. Unless you got anything
else. I think we have to try.

724
00:34:23.494 --> 00:34:25.072
OK. Back-to-back
defensive formation.

725
00:34:25.096 --> 00:34:26.531
Come on. Get behind me.

726
00:34:29.367 --> 00:34:31.502
Sharon.

727
00:34:31.569 --> 00:34:33.604
It has truly been
an honor serving with you.

728
00:34:33.671 --> 00:34:35.073
Likewise. James.

729
00:34:35.139 --> 00:34:36.950
But we're going to continue
serving together. OK?

730
00:34:36.974 --> 00:34:39.610
What. it's like. only 25 meters?

731
00:34:39.677 --> 00:34:41.712
Listen. if you
make it out of this...

732
00:34:41.779 --> 00:34:42.880
James.

733
00:34:42.947 --> 00:34:45.516
If you make it out of this
and I don't...

734
00:34:45.583 --> 00:34:47.318
you tell Eva I love her. OK?

735
00:34:47.385 --> 00:34:49.754
We're both making it
out of here. OK?

736
00:34:49.821 --> 00:34:51.022
You ready?

737
00:34:51.089 --> 00:34:52.090
Ready.

738
00:34:52.156 --> 00:34:53.391
On three.

739
00:34:53.458 --> 00:34:56.494
One. two. three.

740
00:35:07.472 --> 00:35:08.940
Brice. come on.
We're close.

741
00:35:09.006 --> 00:35:11.476
Come on. Brice!

742
00:35:11.542 --> 00:35:12.610
Come on.

743
00:35:12.677 --> 00:35:14.378
-Yes!
-Yes!

744
00:35:14.445 --> 00:35:15.789
Come on. let's get
to the shuttle.

745
00:35:15.813 --> 00:35:16.581
Uh-huh.

746
00:35:25.223 --> 00:35:26.757
Shit.

747
00:35:26.824 --> 00:35:28.759
-Keep going. Back-to-back.
-Come on.

748
00:35:47.845 --> 00:35:49.413
Can you get to the shuttle?

749
00:35:49.480 --> 00:35:50.691
