samples in the underbrush.

785
00:38:46.657 --> 00:38:48.326
You want to come?

786
00:38:50.461 --> 00:38:51.962
I don't need your pity. Angus.

787
00:38:52.029 --> 00:38:53.540
-I'm fine.
-Nothing to do with pity.

788
00:38:53.564 --> 00:38:54.465
I swear.

789
00:38:54.532 --> 00:38:55.842
Gabby's too afraid
to go out there.

790
00:38:55.866 --> 00:38:59.437
but I'd feel safer
if you came instead.

791
00:38:59.503 --> 00:39:02.606
You know.
with your implants and all.

792
00:39:06.510 --> 00:39:07.950
Can I finish my sandwich first?

793
00:39:12.516 --> 00:39:13.894
James. you're late.

794
00:39:13.918 --> 00:39:16.921
I almost changed back into...

795
00:39:16.987 --> 00:39:18.322
oh.

796
00:39:22.960 --> 00:39:24.295
Captain Garnet?

797
00:39:24.362 --> 00:39:26.330
Eva. um...

798
00:39:29.400 --> 00:39:30.944
I really wanted to
do this in person.

799
00:39:30.968 --> 00:39:32.970
but I know you guys
have your regular calls.

800
00:39:33.037 --> 00:39:35.373
so I thought I shouldn't wait.

801
00:39:35.439 --> 00:39:39.977
Just tell me. please.

802
00:39:40.044 --> 00:39:41.512
OK.

803
00:39:43.781 --> 00:39:47.084
When we were making a run to
the shuttle to escape Ross.

804
00:39:47.151 --> 00:39:50.287
James was attacked by some

805
00:39:50.354 --> 00:39:52.089
indigenous creatures.
really big ones.

806
00:39:52.156 --> 00:39:54.458
And...

807
00:39:54.525 --> 00:39:57.027
I'm so sorry. Eva.
but he's dead.

808
00:40:01.065 --> 00:40:02.199
Are you sure?

809
00:40:05.569 --> 00:40:09.273
-And I wish...
-oh. I wish I wasn't.

810
00:40:09.340 --> 00:40:13.477
But I saw him die myself.

811
00:40:13.544 --> 00:40:17.681
I'm so sorry. Eva.

812
00:40:20.050 --> 00:40:21.819
Right before
we made a run for it.

813
00:40:21.886 --> 00:40:26.724
Brice told me to tell you
he loves you so much.

814
00:40:26.791 --> 00:40:29.126
You know he did.

815
00:40:38.369 --> 00:40:40.671
Please send me the WD logs

816
00:40:40.738 --> 00:40:43.641
and the hull camera files
from the shuttle and the Ark.

817
00:40:43.707 --> 00:40:47.778
Eva. you don't want to see it.

818
00:40:47.845 --> 00:40:50.714
It's pretty bad.

819
00:40:50.781 --> 00:40:54.852
Seeing it myself is the only
way I'll be able to accept it.

820
00:40:58.389 --> 00:41:00.624
So how do you like being free?

821
00:41:00.691 --> 00:41:02.960
I didn't really mind
being locked up.

822
00:41:03.027 --> 00:41:05.629
At least no one bothered me.

823
00:41:13.871 --> 00:41:16.607
-Where are you going?
-Kelly. come back.

824
00:41:16.674 --> 00:41:18.142
Did you hear that over there?

825
00:41:18.209 --> 00:41:20.411
Yes. which is why we should
be going the other way.

826
00:41:20.478 --> 00:41:21.521
Don't you want
to know what it is?

827
00:41:21.545 --> 00:41:23.447
-No!
-Not particularly.

828
00:41:23.514 --> 00:41:25.950
-Come on. Angus.
-That's why you brought me.

828
00:41:26.305 --> 00:42:26.592
